\ A top-level redefinition of a generic native is an ordinary new binding in its own scope. A
\ call site parsed before it keeps the native, warm or cold; a call site parsed after it reaches
\ the redefinition.

sub10: ( x -- y ) [ 10.0 - ] ;
1.0 sub10 .

-: override ( a b -- c ) [ drop drop 7.0 ] ;

\ The pre-resolved site keeps the native for a warm float pair and a cold mixed pair alike.
1.0 sub10 .
1 sub10 .

\ A call site parsed after the redefinition reaches the new binding.
1.0 2.0 - .
